{"title":"Career Roadmap — Site Supervisor","role":"Site Supervisor","summary":"Role overview:\nA Site Supervisor in interior design coordinates the day-to-day execution of interior projects at site. The role connects the designer, client, contractors, vendors and skilled workers, ensuring that drawings are implemented correctly, materials arrive on time, workmanship meets standards and work progresses safely according to schedule.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Interior Design (B.Sc)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Interior/site internship + execution portfolio"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Site supervision + estimation + project coordination"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Project management, contracts and team leadership"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Project leadership, technology and business management"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career-route check"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Interior Design","Site/Design Internship","Site Supervisor Trainee","Site Supervisor","Senior Site Supervisor","Site Manager / Project Coordinator","Project Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong practical alignment. The degree provides design knowledge, while site experience develops construction coordination and execution capability."},{"type":"note","label":"Timeline assumption","text":"The roadmap assumes the student starts UG in 2026. B.Sc programme duration may be 3 or 4 years depending on the university structure."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These are career-planning horizons, not guaranteed promotion timelines."}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this"