},{"text":"HVAC coordination"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The supervisor does not necessarily perform every trade but must understand how different trades interact."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Drawing interpretation"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable reading:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Floor plans"},{"text":"Furniture layouts"},{"text":"Ceiling plans"},{"text":"Flooring layouts"},{"text":"Elevations"},{"text":"Sections"},{"text":"Detail drawings"},{"text":"Electrical layouts"},{"text":"Plumbing layouts"},{"text":"HVAC layouts"},{"text":"Joinery drawings"},{"text":"Material schedules"},{"text":"Door/window schedules"},{"text":"Shop drawings"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should be able to identify discrepancies between drawing, material and actual site condition."}]},{"heading":"AutoCAD and digital drawings","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Layers"},{"text":"Blocks"},{"text":"Dimensions"},{"text":"Hatching"},{"text":"Annotation"},{"text":"Scales"},{"text":"Layouts"},{"text":"Xrefs"},{"text":"Drawing standards"},{"text":"Printing/PDF output"},{"text":"Revision management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Autodesk AutoCAD","url":"https://www.autodesk.com/products/autocad/overview"}]},{"heading":"BIM","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build an introduction to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BIM concepts"},{"text":"3D modelling"},{"text":"Architectural models"},{"text":"Interior elements"},{"text":"Model coordination"},{"text":"Clash detection"},{"text":"Quantities"},{"text":"Drawing extraction"},{"text":"Revision management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A student can later develop skills in Revit, Navisworks and BIM coordination."}]},{"heading":"Measurement and quantity estimation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site measurements"},{"text":"Area calculations"},{"text":"Volume calculations"},{"text":"Material quantities"},{"text":"Wastage"},{"text":"Labour quantities"},{"text":"BOQ preparation"},{"text":"Rate analysis"},{"text":"Cost estimation"},{"text":"Vendor quotations"},{"text":"Comparative statements"},{"text":"Purchase orders"},{"text":"Invoice checking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"For a flooring project:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Room dimensions","Area","Tile quantity","Wastage","Adhesive/grout","Labour","Total cost"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is an essential skill for moving beyond basic supervision."}]},{"heading":"Site execution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to supervise:"},{"type":"h","text":"Civil"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Masonry"},{"text":"Plaster"},{"text":"Screeding"},{"text":"Flooring"},{"text":"Waterproofing"},{"text":"Repairs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ceiling"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gypsum ceiling"},{"text":"Grid ceiling"},{"text":"Access panels"},{"text":"Lighting coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Carpentry"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Furniture"},{"text":"Cabinets"},{"text":"Wardrobes"},{"text":"Kitchen units"},{"text":"Veneer/laminate"},{"text":"Hardware"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finishes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Putty"},{"text":"Primer"},{"text":"Paint"},{"text":"Wallpaper"},{"text":"Decorative finishes"},{"text":"Stone"},{"text":"Tile"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Services"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electrical"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Plumbing"},{"text":"HVAC"},{"text":"Fire systems"},{"text":"Data/networking"}]}]},{"heading":"Quality control","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to inspect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dimensions"},{"text":"Alignment"},{"text":"Level"},{"text":"Plumb"},{"text":"Surface finish"},{"text":"Material quality"},{"text":"Installation quality"},{"text":"Joint quality"},{"text":"Colour/finish consistency"},{"text":"Hardware operation"},{"text":"Electrical points"},{"text":"Plumbing fixtures"},{"text":"Ceiling levels"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Inspection checklist","Observation","Defect","Corrective action","Reinspection","Closure"]}]},{"heading":"Site documentation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Maintain:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Daily progress report"},{"text":"Site diary"},{"text":"Material inward register"},{"text":"Labour attendance"},{"text":"Work-progress photographs"},{"text":"Drawing register"},{"text":"Revision register"},{"text":"Inspection checklist"},{"text":"Snag list"},{"text":"Measurement sheet"},{"text":"BOQ"},{"text":"Purchase records"},{"text":"Vendor records"},{"text":"Client instructions"},{"text":"Site meeting minutes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Strong documentation is one of the biggest differences between a basic site supervisor and a professional project coordinator."}]},{"heading":"Scheduling","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Work breakdown structure"},{"text":"Activity sequencing"},{"text":"Dependencies"},{"text":"Critical activities"},{"text":"Milestones"},{"text":"Daily targets"},{"text":"Weekly planning"},{"text":"Resource planning"},{"text":"Material lead times"},{"text":"Delay tracking"},{"text":"Recovery planning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Microsoft Project"},{"text":"Primavera P6"},{"text":"Trello/other task systems"},{"text":"BIM/project-management platforms"}]}]},{"heading":"Safety","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A site supervisor should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PPE"},{"text":"Work at height"},{"text":"Electrical safety"},{"text":"Fire safety"},{"text":"Hot work"},{"text":"Power tools"},{"text":"Ladders/scaffolding"},{"text":"Material handling"},{"text":"Housekeeping"},{"text":"Emergency procedures"},{"text":"Permit systems"},{"text":"First aid"},{"text":"Contractor safety"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Safety responsibility may vary by project and employer, but the supervisor should never ignore unsafe work."}]},{"heading":"Communication and coordination","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to coordinate between:"},{"type":"h","text":"Client ↔ Designer ↔ Architect ↔ Contractor ↔ Vendor ↔ Workers ↔ MEP teams"},{"type":"p","text":"Important skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Daily briefings"},{"text":"Site meetings"},{"text":"Vendor communication"},{"text":"Client updates"},{"text":"Conflict resolution"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Technical explanation"},{"text":"Professional WhatsApp/email communication"},{"text":"Escalation of issues"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Residential Interiors"},{"text":"Interior execution, materials, carpentry"},{"text":"Interior firms"},{"text":"Senior Site Supervisor"}],[{"text":"Commercial Interiors"},{"text":"MEP, schedules, coordination"},{"text":"Commercial projects"},{"text":"Project Coordinator"}],[{"text":"Hospitality Interiors"},{"text":"Hotels, luxury finishes, MEP"},{"text":"Hotel projects"},{"text":"Hospitality Project Manager"}],[{"text":"Retail Interiors"},{"text":"Fast execution, branding, fit-outs"},{"text":"Retail projects"},{"text":"Retail Project Manager"}],[{"text":"Corporate Interiors"},{"text":"Office fit-outs, BIM, coordination"},{"text":"Corporate projects"},{"text":"Corporate Interiors PM"}],[{"text":"Modular Interiors"},{"text":"Manufacturing + installation"},{"text":"Modular companies"},{"text":"Installation Manager"}],[{"text":"Estimation"},{"text":"BOQ, rate analysis, costing"},{"text":"QS/project teams"},{"text":"Estimation Engineer"}],[{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"Revit, coordination, clash detection"},{"text":"BIM teams"},{"text":"BIM Coordinator"}],[{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"Scheduling, contracts, risk"},{"text":"Project-management teams"},{"text":"Project Manager"}],[{"text":"Design + Execution"},{"text":"Design + site implementation"},{"text":"Design-build firms"},{"text":"Design Project Manager"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Four-year honours variant"},{"type":"p","text":"If the B.Sc is a 4-year Honours/Honours with Research programme, use the additional year to build a stronger execution profile through:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced BIM"},{"text":"Quantity surveying"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Sustainable materials"},{"text":"Construction technology"},{"text":"Building services coordination"},{"text":"Dissertation/research"},{"text":"Major interior project"},{"text":"Extended industry internship"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest portfolio would show the complete cycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Design","Drawing","BOQ","Material Selection","Site Execution","Quality Inspection","Snagging","Handover"]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / public / institutional"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for internships or practical exposure with:"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation/area","Exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"CPWD"},{"text":"Building and interior works"}],[{"text":"State PWD"},{"text":"Public-building construction"}],[{"text":"Government construction departments"},{"text":"Site execution"}],[{"text":"Public-sector companies"},{"text":"Corporate facilities and projects"}],[{"text":"Government housing projects"},{"text":"Residential construction"}],[{"text":"Municipal bodies"},{"text":"Building/infrastructure works"}],[{"text":"IITs/IIMs/universities"},{"text":"Campus construction and facility projects"}],[{"text":"Government convention facilities"},{"text":"Large interior/venue projects"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For current public-sector opportunities, always check the organisation's official recruitment/internship page."},{"type":"h","text":"Private / industry"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interior design studios"},{"text":"Turnkey interior companies"},{"text":"Architecture firms"},{"text":"Construction companies"},{"text":"Real-estate developers"},{"text":"Modular furniture companies"},{"text":"Retail fit-out companies"},{"text":"Hotel construction/renovation teams"},{"text":"Corporate office fit-out firms"},{"text":"Project-management consultancies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Employer categories worth researching include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Asian Paints"},{"text":"Godrej Interio"},{"text":"Livspace"},{"text":"HomeLane"},{"text":"DesignCafe"},{"text":"Saint-Gobain"},{"text":"Kajaria"},{"text":"Jaquar"},{"text":"Häfele"},{"text":"L&T"},{"text":"DLF"},{"text":"Prestige Group"},{"text":"Shapoorji Pallonji"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact internship availability should be for the application year."}]},{"heading":"Certifications in demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / training","Why it helps"],"rows":[[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"2D construction/interior drawings"}],[{"text":"Autodesk Revit"},{"text":"BIM and 3D coordination"}],[{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"Interior modelling"}],[{"text":"3ds Max/Blender"},{"text":"Visualisation"}],[{"text":"Quantity Estimation"},{"text":"BOQ and costing"}],[{"text":"Construction Safety"},{"text":"Site safety"}],[{"text":"First Aid/CPR"},{"text":"Emergency readiness"}],[{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"Planning and coordination"}],[{"text":"Primavera P6"},{"text":"Advanced scheduling"}],[{"text":"Microsoft Project"},{"text":"Project scheduling"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Costing and reporting"}],[{"text":"BIM Fundamentals"},{"text":"Digital project coordination"}],[{"text":"Interior Materials"},{"text":"Specification and execution"}],[{"text":"MEP Coordination"},{"text":"Services coordination"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Building"},{"text":"Green construction"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not pursue certificates simply to increase the number on a CV. For this career, site exposure, drawings, BOQs, execution knowledge and project portfolios are especially valuable."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Realistic first-job titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site Supervisor Trainee"},{"text":"Junior Site Supervisor"},{"text":"Site Supervisor"},{"text":"Interior Site Supervisor"},{"text":"Interior Execution Executive"},{"text":"Site Coordinator"},{"text":"Interior Project Coordinator"},{"text":"Interior Project Executive"},{"text":"Fit-out Executive"},{"text":"Fit-out Site Coordinator"},{"text":"Interior Site Executive"},{"text":"Project Assistant"},{"text":"Construction Coordinator"},{"text":"Junior Project Coordinator"},{"text":"Quantity Surveying Trainee"},{"text":"Estimation Assistant"},{"text":"Interior Design Execution Assistant"},{"text":"Vendor Coordination Executive"},{"text":"Site Operations Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Role-to-skill mapping"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"Site Supervisor"},{"text":"Site execution, drawings, quality"},{"text":"Internship/site project"}],[{"text":"Interior Site Executive"},{"text":"Interior materials + execution"},{"text":"Interior project"}],[{"text":"Site Coordinator"},{"text":"Coordination + documentation"},{"text":"Site diary"}],[{"text":"Fit-out Executive"},{"text":"Fit-out + MEP coordination"},{"text":"Commercial internship"}],[{"text":"Estimation Assistant"},{"text":"BOQ + Excel"},{"text":"Sample estimate"}],[{"text":"Project Coordinator"},{"text":"Planning + communication"},{"text":"Project portfolio"}],[{"text":"BIM Coordinator Trainee"},{"text":"Revit + coordination"},{"text":"BIM model"}],[{"text":"Quantity Surveying Trainee"},{"text":"Measurement + costing"},{"text":"BOQ project"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career reality"},{"type":"p","text":"Site Supervisor is a realistic entry-level career for this degree."},{"type":"p","text":"However, responsibilities vary significantly between companies. Some employers 