ant Project Manager","Project Manager","Senior Project Manager / Construction Manager","Projects Head / Operations Head"]},{"type":"p","text":"An alternative design-led path is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Interior Designer","Senior Interior Designer","Design Lead","Design + Execution Lead","Studio/Project Director"]},{"type":"note","label":"Future-ready skills","text":"2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"The role will increasingly combine physical site management with digital project systems."},{"type":"p","text":"Important future capabilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"AI-assisted design review"},{"text":"Automated quantity takeoff"},{"text":"Construction analytics"},{"text":"Drone/site documentation"},{"text":"3D scanning"},{"text":"AR/VR site visualisation"},{"text":"Digital procurement"},{"text":"Smart-building systems"},{"text":"Sustainable materials"},{"text":"Energy-efficient interiors"},{"text":"Construction waste reduction"},{"text":"Building-performance monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest professionals will therefore become design + construction + technology + project-management specialists, rather than relying only on traditional site supervision."}]}]}